ecide now"><h2>To decide at this stand-up</h2><ol class="decide"><li><b>PrompTugal outreach batch 1</b>: send all 50, a first ten, or rework the text</li><li><b>WS-189</b>: the stand's interviews write to the private CRM; a visitor's contact: in the CRM or not</li><li><b>Access tokens per agent</b>: crm-silvio first (Silvio's ask)</li><li><b>The parking list</b>: 45 board issues to park, 20 kept (project-manager@)</li><li><b>Friday's 18:00</b>: nothing recorded; one line per decision</li></ol></section><section class="slide" aria-label="Follow-ups"><h2>Follow-ups, each with an owner</h2><ul><li><b>Dinis</b>: Gmail on inbox@'s session; António's emails</li><li><b>Silvio</b>: WS-189 with Dinis; the merch pickup on Monday</li><li><b>Angelo</b>: specs before builds; the first LinkedIn post</li><li><b>Vicky, Indi</b>: the team series and the stories to PrompTugal</li><li><b>Dinis's conductor</b>: record this stand-up, line by line; the 18:00 deck</li></ul></section></div>
